# k.colours/shards/colours: 33 colours (red, scarlet, crimson, maroon, orange, peach, amber, yellow, cream, mustard, gold, green, light green, lime, dark green, olive, turquoise, blue, light blue, navy, purple, lilac, magenta, pink, brown, beige, chestnut, black, grey, light grey, dark grey, silver, white): the family, light or dark, warm or cool, a lighter and a darker colour, the opposite on the colour wheel, things that typically have the colour; 25 pairs of colours and what they mix into; and other names of the colours.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: tools/colours-shapes-core.mjs)
